  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Governance expert UNHCR &#x2013; VEi Kenya - Kakuma 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective initiative is to provide technical leadership for enhancing the sustainability of the water systems in the refugee settlements and accelerate the transition from humanitarian-led services to utility-managed services, offering sustainable water services with low operating costs, cost-recovery mechanisms and local ownership. Tailored water system-wide upgrades, extensions and optimization as well as solarization, combined with capacity-building are required to ensure that the systems can be maintained and sustainably operated by the utilities after handover.</narrative>
  </description>
